     "titulo": "More precise symptoms",
     "texto": [
      "**Zawroty głowy** means «dizziness»; **ból pleców**, «backache».",
      "In Polish, the verb with these symptoms is usually singular: **Boli mnie głowa** («my head hurts»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Medical results",
     "texto": [
      "**Wyniki badań** are the results of tests.",
      "**Wykluczyć** means to rule out a cause; **podejrzewać** means to suspect it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
